# Copy this file to .env (or .env.local) and fill in your key to switch the
# widget from the built-in mock address system to real Google Places
# Autocomplete + Geocoding + a satellite map. Leave unset to keep the
# zero-cost mock demo behavior.
#
# Requires a Google Cloud project with billing enabled and these APIs turned
# on: "Maps JavaScript API", "Places API", "Geocoding API". Restrict the key
# by HTTP referrer to your domain(s) in Google Cloud Console — this is a
# browser key, not a secret, and it WILL be visible in the built JS bundle.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
